		Remediation: Return to Workbook 3, Chapter 4: Consultation and Seeking Professional Assistance; review Urgent Threat and Consultation; log error category CONSULTATION-AND-ASSISTANCE.',
	),
	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A therapist has reasonable suspicion of child abuse. The therapist’s supervisor believes the facts are insufficient and directs the therapist not to report. What should the therapist do?',
		'option_a'       => 'Make the report within the statutory timeframe because the mandated-reporting duty is individual',
