	),
	array(
		'question_text'  => 'Two qualified consultants give opposite recommendations about whether to continue treatment during a planned transfer. What is the therapist’s best response?',
		'option_a'       => 'Clarify the consultants’ assumptions, reassess risk and continuity, obtain further input if needed, and make and document an independent decision',
