	array(
		'question_text'  => 'A clinician is asked to move from a treatment role into an evaluative or forensic role involving the same person. To decide how to proceed, the clinician must apply the correct meaning of most directly defines a clinician’s professional role in a particular matter. Which explanation should guide the next professional step?',
		'option_a'       => 'The clinician’s preferred theoretical orientation',
