	array(
		'question_text'  => 'During consultation, a therapist evaluates whether multiple professional roles would create conflicting duties or misleading expectations. Under California Evidence Code section 1017, which statement is generally accurate about a psychotherapist appointed by court order to examine a person?',
		'option_a'       => 'Psychotherapist-patient privilege generally does not apply to communications in the court-appointed examination, subject to a specified criminal-defense exception',
