		C. Correct. This is the balanced analysis tested by the examination framework.
		D. Incorrect. Multiple roles can affect objectivity, coercion, confidentiality, and client welfare without any sexual conduct.
		CTA Exam Strategy: Avoid absolute answers. Assess the actual conflict, necessity, risk, and ability to manage the role safely.
