		D. Incorrect. Immediate termination may harm the child, and release of records requires separate authorization, privilege, and confidentiality analysis.
		CTA Exam Strategy: When treatment is being converted into a forensic role, choose clarification, competence analysis, and an independent evaluator rather than informal relabeling.
