	array(
		'question_text'  => 'Before accepting a third-party evaluation, a clinician must clarify who the client is, the purpose of the service, and how information may be used. Which explanation is most important before a third-party psychological or clinical evaluation begins?',
		'option_a'       => 'The evaluator will advocate for whichever party pays the fee',
